{"id":"u106","kelas":"kosa","no":7,"judul":"Pakaian dan Belanja","title":"Clothes and Shopping","emoji":"👕","ringkas":"Pakaian, ukuran, warna, harga, dan tawar-menawar","ready":true,"goals":["mempelajari **nama pakaian, warna, dan ukuran**","bertanya **harga** dan memilih barang di toko","mengenali kata melalui **arti, ejaan, dan pendengaran**","memakai pola *How much is ...?* dan *Do you have ... in size ...?*"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Berbelanja memerlukan kata untuk pakaian, ukuran, dan harga. Pelajari kata-kata di bawah dan pola kalimat: **How much is this?**, **Can I try it on?**, **Do you have a smaller size?**"},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Pakaian","items":[{"en":"shirt","id":"kemeja","ex":"He wears a white shirt."},{"en":"trousers","id":"celana panjang","ex":"These trousers are too long."},{"en":"skirt","id":"rok","ex":"She wears a blue skirt."},{"en":"jacket","id":"jaket","ex":"Put on your jacket."},{"en":"dress","id":"gaun","ex":"That dress is beautiful."},{"en":"socks","id":"kaus kaki","ex":"I need new socks."},{"en":"shoes","id":"sepatu","ex":"My shoes are old."},{"en":"hat","id":"topi","ex":"He wears a hat in the sun."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Ukuran dan kondisi","items":[{"en":"size","id":"ukuran","ex":"What size do you wear?"},{"en":"small","id":"kecil","ex":"This shirt is too small."},{"en":"large","id":"besar","ex":"I need a large size."},{"en":"tight","id":"ketat / sempit","ex":"These shoes are tight."},{"en":"loose","id":"longgar","ex":"This jacket is loose."},{"en":"fit","id":"pas","ex":"The trousers fit well."},{"en":"cheap","id":"murah","ex":"This bag is cheap."},{"en":"expensive","id":"mahal","ex":"That watch is expensive."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Di toko","items":[{"en":"price","id":"harga","ex":"What is the price?"},{"en":"discount","id":"diskon","ex":"There is a discount today."},{"en":"receipt","id":"struk","ex":"Keep the receipt."},{"en":"cashier","id":"kasir","ex":"Pay the cashier."},{"en":"try on","id":"mencoba (pakaian)","ex":"Can I try on this shirt?"},{"en":"customer","id":"pelanggan","ex":"The customer wants a refund."},{"en":"sale","id":"obral","ex":"The shop has a big sale."},{"en":"refund","id":"pengembalian uang","ex":"I want a refund."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Di toko pakaian","lines":[{"who":"Rani","en":"Excuse me, how much is this dress?","id":"Permisi, berapa harga gaun ini?"},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"It is eighty thousand rupiah.","id":"Harganya delapan puluh ribu rupiah."},{"who":"Rani","en":"Do you have a smaller size?","id":"Apakah ada ukuran lebih kecil?"},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Yes, here you are. You can try it on.","id":"Ada, silakan. Anda boleh mencobanya."},{"who":"Rani","en":"It fits well. I will take it.","id":"Pas sekali. Saya ambil."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Please pay the cashier.","id":"Silakan bayar ke kasir."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghafal","text":"Saat berbelanja, sebutkan nama barang dalam bahasa Inggris dalam hati (*shirt, shoes, price*). Latihan dalam situasi nyata lebih cepat membekas."},{"t":"summary","items":["Pakaian: [[shirt]], [[trousers]], [[skirt]], [[jacket]], [[dress]], [[socks]].","Ukuran dan kondisi: [[size]], [[small]], [[large]], [[tight]], [[loose]], [[fit]].","Di toko: [[price]], [[discount]], [[receipt]], [[cashier]], [[try on]], [[customer]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"shirt\"?","options":["kemeja","pengembalian uang","harga","celana panjang"],"answer":0,"exp":"shirt = kemeja.","k":"8989e9db"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"kemeja\" adalah...","options":["shirt","receipt","discount","price"],"answer":0,"exp":"kemeja = shirt.","k":"f311770e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Isi dengan kata Inggris untuk \"kemeja\":","q":"He wears a white ___.","answers":["shirt","shirt"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _","exp":"kemeja = shirt.","k":"cd2bd533"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"trousers\"?","options":["celana panjang","rok","kecil","jaket"],"answer":0,"exp":"trousers = celana panjang.","k":"abddc882"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata